---
description: Copier agent rules (Python)
globs: copier/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- Python 3.11+, uv, pytest, ruff. `policy.py` is pure and fully unit-tested (one test per limit at minimum).
- `--dry-run` is the default. Live trading requires an explicit `--live` flag and the follower's own HL API wallet key from env.
- The copier never holds the trader's keys or address. It only consumes TradeEvents from the gateway.
- Respect HL lot size and tick size rounding. Reject rather than guess.
- Vendored baseline fleet code lives in `src/copier/vendor/` with a `# baseline:` header.
